    </div>

    <!-- ================= The chapters (plain document when scripts are off) ================= -->
    <main id="main" class="chapters" data-chapters>
      <!-- Research -->
      <article class="chapter" id="research" data-chapter>
        <header class="ch-head">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true" set:html={icons.research} />
          <p class="label">Library</p>
          <h2 class="h2">Research</h2>
          <p class="lead">
            My research on inclusive education policy in Nigeria asks one question: why do commitments made in law stall
            before they reach children?
          </p>
        </header>
        <div class="ch-grid">
          <div class="glass">
            <p class="label plain">The doctoral study</p>
            <h3 class="h3">Five schools in Osun State</h3>
            <ul class="bullets">
              <li>Qualitative fieldwork in five schools, three private and two state-run, in December 2024</li>
              <li>48 adult participants and 15 learner narratives</li>
              <li>Interviews run, transcribed and analysed in Yoruba and English, with no translator in between</li>
              <li>Policy document analysis at international, federal and state level</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="glass">
            <p class="label plain">Idea 01</p>
            <h3 class="h3">Culturally Negotiated Inclusion</h3>
            <p>Communities do not simply fail to implement inclusion. They reshape it.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="glass">
            <p class="label plain">Idea 02</p>
            <h3 class="h3">Advocacy Literacy</h3>
            <p>
              The competence families, mothers in particular, build to claim entitlements for their children that exist
              only on paper.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ch-meter">
          <div><b data-count="5">5</b><span>schools</span></div>
          <div><b data-count="48">48</b><span>adults interviewed</span></div>
          <div><b data-count="15">15</b><span>learner narratives</span></div>
          <div><b data-count="3">3</b><span>journal articles published</span></div>
        </div>
        <p class="ch-more"><a class="btn ghost" href="/research">Open the full research page <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p>
      </article>

      <!-- Education -->
      <article class="chapter" id="education" data-chapter>
        <header class="ch-head">
